  "title": {
    "zh": "维修窗合约",
    "en": "Repair Window Contracts"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "单工位 · 收益冲突 · 并列时少接单",
    "en": "One bay · Competing rewards · Fewer jobs on a tie"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "tasks 每单为 [开始, 结束, 报酬]，已按结束时间升序。所选维修必须从开始一直占到结束，不能重叠，结束时刻可以接下一单，报酬可以为 0。返回 [能拿到的最高总报酬, 达到此报酬最少要接几单]。可以一单都不接。",
    "en": "Each task is [start, end, reward] and the tasks are sorted by end time. A selected repair occupies the bay for its entire interval. Jobs cannot overlap, but another can begin right when one ends. Rewards may be zero. Return [highest total reward, fewest jobs needed to get that reward]. You may decline every job."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "best_repair_contracts",
  "starterCode": "def best_repair_contracts(tasks):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "def best_repair_contracts(tasks):\n    best = [[0, 0]]\n    for i in range(len(tasks)):\n        current = tasks[i]\n        compatible = i\n        while compatible > 0 and tasks[compatible - 1][1] > current[0]:\n            compatible -= 1\n        before = best[compatible]\n        reward = before[0] + current[2]\n        chosen = before[1] + 1\n        skip = best[i]\n        if reward > skip[0] or (reward == skip[0] and chosen < skip[1]):\n            best.append([reward, chosen])\n        else:\n            best.append(skip)\n    return best[len(tasks)]\n",
  "snippets": [
    {
      "label": {
        "zh": "读取维修时段和报酬",
        "en": "Read an interval and reward"
      },
      "code": "    for task in tasks:\n        start = task[0]\n        end = task[1]\n        reward = task[2]"
